Embedded Augeas lens corpus
===========================

The `.aug` files in this directory (and in `tests/`) are the *unmodified*
lens sources from the upstream Augeas project:

    Project:  Augeas (https://augeas.net / https://github.com/hercules-team/augeas)
    Version:  1.14.1
    Commit:   22d715e8d4ad133e2eb085b9b38d1e4a37f911d2 (2026-04-08)
    Authors:  David Lutterkort and the Augeas contributors (see upstream AUTHORS)

